WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>Humpty Dumpty will be{in position} over the target area in approximately five hours.</b>

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.400
<b>And where's Westcott?</b>

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Right where we want him.</b>

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.740
<b>He hasn't moved from his hotel in Tenguu city.</b>

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.860
<b>She ponders, "What might have happened if I was truer to myself?"</b>

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.000
<b>She wishes upon a shooting star,</b>

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.380
<b>"If I'd just had the courage{to change}."</b>

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.500
Episode 5: Despair Falls

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.500
Episode 5: Despair Falls

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.500
<b>We might've pushed her a little too far. {That might've been too much for her}</b>

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.170
<b>I didn't expect her to hate it that much.</b>

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.220
<b>No, I don't think she hated it.</b>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Affection</b>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Mood</b>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Kindness</b>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Mind</b>

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Her state of mind, mood, and affection levels have all increased from their previous levels.</b>

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.900
<b>She's probably just not used to being complimented in her true form.</b>

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.880
<b>Even if deep down, she actually wanted her true form to be complimented,</b>

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.490
<b>she lacked the confidence to even try.</b>

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.900
<b>Oh yeah, she said that nobody in this world would even look at her unless she transformed.</b>

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:06.870
<b>And those repeated experiences warped her self-value.</b>

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.780
<b>What's important to her isn't whether or not she's beautiful,</b>

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:14.160
<b>but whether or not someone accepts her for who she truly is.</b>

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.470
<b>Liars, all of them. {They're all lying to me. I know it}</b>

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.300
<b>Haniel.</b>

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.240
<b>I'm gonna expose all of you.</b>

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.240
<b>Tohka? Yoshino?</b>

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.340
<b>Hello.</b>

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.920
<b>Are you taking a break too, Kotori?</b>

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.790
<b>So what do you two think of <i>that</i>?</b>

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.210
<b>Natsumi, that is.</b>

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.710
<b>What do we think?</b>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.760
<b>Isn't she like, totally lame?</b>

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.710
<b>It's actually pathetic how ugly she is, right?</b>

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.040
<b>What's gotten into you Kotori?</b>

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.220
<b>You're acting weird.</b>

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.220
<b>Huh?</b>

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:06.540
<b>Um, I don't think Natsumi-san is lame at all.</b>

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.780
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.900
<b>H-Huh? What?</b>

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.600
<b>Isn't someone that gloomy just really annoying?</b>

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.900
<b>Why are you all here?</b>

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.570
<b>What's wrong, Kotori? You look angry.</b>

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.380
<b>Seriously, everyone... Tohka and Yoshino are saying some crazy things right now.</b>

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.460
<b>Question: Crazy? Like what?</b>

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:32.590
<b>They're saying that Natsumi's actually cute,
 and not a huge pain, and...</b>

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:38.500
<b>I think <i>you're</i> the one saying crazy things.</b>

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.940
<b>Suspicion: This isn't like you, Kotori.</b>

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:45.400
<b>There's nothing wrong with Natsumi, you meanie!</b>

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.980
<b><i>No way. This can't be... I....</i></b>

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.980
<b>What's with that face?</b>

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:51.980
<b>Huh? Kotori?</b>

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.240
<b>Kotori? Sorry, are you okay?</b>

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.080
<b>You look down. Something wrong?</b>

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.990
<b>No, I'm fine.</b>

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.370
<b>Oh, right, I meant to ask you about Natsumi's meals.</b>

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.630
<b>Bingo. Show your true colors.</b>

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:16.000
<b>Would it be okay if we let Natsumi out of her room?</b>

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.680
<b>I've been thinking about this a lot,</b>

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:23.360
<b>but it's gotta be lonely to eat by herself, don't you think?</b>

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:28.940
<b>So maybe if she ate a good meal with us,
 she might cheer up a little.</b>

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.100
<b>Hey, what's wrong?</b>

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.650
<b>Is it a bad idea?</b>

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.650
<b>Shut up! Jerk!</b>

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.610
<b>Kotori, wait!</b>

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.860
<b>I can't believe she left a lollipop behind.</b>

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.620
<b>What happened to her?</b>

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.960
<b>Kotori?</b>

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.740
<b>What's gotten into you?</b>

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.140
<b>Huh? What are you talking about?</b>

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.980
<b>But that can wait. We have an emergency.</b>

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:09.280
<b>Natsumi's escaped from her room!</b>

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.740
<b>Not good. I've searched everywhere, but I can't find her!</b>

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.190
<b>I don't want to consider it, but...</b>

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.660
<b>Thank god... There you ar—</b>

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.940
<b>You!</b>

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.160
<b>Pardon the intrusion.</b>

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.670
<b>Ellen! What are you doing here?!</b>

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:41.050
<b>What have I done to be graced by the
 presence of the high-and-mighty DEM?</b>

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.050
<b>I'm only here to ask you a question.</b>

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.050
<b>A question?</b>

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.240
<b>Yes.</b>

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:53.400
<b>Where might Witch, the spirit that you whisked away with the other day, be?</b>

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.120
<b>As if I'd ever tell you!</b>

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.270
<b>Really?</b>

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.380
<b>Nice house you have.</b>

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.400
<b>You must live a good life here.</b>

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:10.280
<b>It'd be a shame if you were to lose it.</b>

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.600
<b>I'll ask one more time.</b>

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.540
<b>In exchange for the lives of the other six Spirits,</b>

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.440
<b>tell me where Witch is.</b>

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.300
<b>Any trace of Natsumi?</b>

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.200
<b>Nothing from Point A.</b>

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.300
<b>Nothing from Point B.</b>

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:27.800
<b>Not good.</b>

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:32.060
<b>If she's taken steps to actively try and avoid us...{TLC - This is a little short.}{If she has her guard up, then she's probably not too happy.}{We actually discussed this line and really you can omit the second part as there is an inference that she's not gonna be happy if she's hiding.}</b>

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.100
<b>This pattern...</b>

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.220
<b>Is it Natsumi?</b>

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:41.320
<b>No, judging by the altitude and trajectory of this unknown signal, it's likely a satellite.</b>

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.520
<b>That's strange. Why is a satellite—</b>

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.570
<b>Commander!</b>

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.480
<b>It's faint, but there's magic coming from it...</b>

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.070
<b>It's a bomb!</b>

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.080
<b>We have a visual!</b>

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.120
<b>A{The} Bandersnatch?</b>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.080
<b>That explains it.</b>

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.080
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.620
<b>It's me.</b>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.280
<b>Understood.</b>

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.980
<b>I'll deal with it.</b>

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:20.270
<b>You're a lucky guy, Itsuka Shidou.</b>

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.620
<b>Find Natsumi?</b>

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.400
<b>No, but I've had my share of trouble.</b>

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.780
<b>Shidou, stay calm and listen.</b>

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.820
<b>It might be hard to believe,</b>

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.790
<b>but a satellite is going to fall on
 Tenguu City in less than half an hour.</b>

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.840
<b>W-Wait! Why is a...</b>

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.220
<b>No time to explain.</b>

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.220
<b>At any rate, you're in danger out there.</b>

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:45.420
<b>Get to one of the shelters.</b>

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.460
<b>What about Tohka and the others?</b>

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.000
<b>Don't worry about them.</b>

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.080
<b>Fragments from the wreckage won't even scratch the shelters.</b>

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.060
<b>Fragments?</b>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.470
<b>That's right. We're going to shoot it down.</b>

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.800
<b>Just keep looking for Natsumi for as long as you can.</b>

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.800
<b>But if you can't find her,
 promise me you'll get to a shelter.</b>

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.440
<b>Okay, I promise.</b>

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.400
<b>We're counting on you, Shidou.</b>

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.280
<b>Kotori?</b>

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:08.940
<b>What?</b>

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.700
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.000
<b>I'm supposed to be the one thanking you.</b>

