00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.660
<b>Got it, Natsumi?!</b>

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.000
<b>You won't have to be locked up in a room anymore.</b>

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.120
<b>You can go wherever you want after this is all over!</b>

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.620
<b>So just...</b>

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.700
<b><i>Why are you going so far for me?</i></b>

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.460
<b><i>You know you're frantically searching for the real me right now, don't you?</i></b>

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.920
<b><i>I made a mess of your life.</i></b>

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.210
<b><i>I even made your friends disappear.</i></b>

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.590
<b><i>I did all sorts of bad things to you.</i></b>

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:15.390
<b><i>Why are you trying so hard just for me?</i></b>

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:22.310
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.810
<b>Commander! The satellite!</b>

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.560
<b>Here it comes.</b>

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.270
<b>Calculate its collision course.</b>

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.530
<b>Roger!</b>

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.530
<b>We're going to shoot it down.</b>

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.030
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.280
<b>Natsumi, are you following me?!</b>

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.480
<b>I'm right here!</b>

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.710
<b>I'm right—</b>

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.090
<b>Mysteltainn, fire!</b>

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.660
<b>What happened?</b>

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.340
<b>How odd.</b>

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:01.300
<b>A single Bandersnatch couldn't produce a realizer strong enough to deflect the Mysteltainn.</b>

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.850
<b>What now?!</b>

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.180
<b>Enemy at twelve o'clock.{TLC}{correct}</b>

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.350
<b>Getting visual now.</b>

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.110
<b>That's...</b>

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.360
<b>Commander!</b>

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.060
<b>Right now we need to...</b>

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.980
<b>Kannazuki, take over.</b>

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.370
<b>Yes, Commander.</b>

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:30.250
<b>I suppose it's time for me to enter the fray.</b>

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:48.730
<b>Camael.</b>

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.120
<b>Megido!</b>

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.990
<b>Here I come.</b>

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.420
<b>Gungnir!{what is this? Nymphogear?}</b>

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.710
<b>Fire! {I like how this is the only part that doesn't have a fantastical name.}</b>

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:18.510
<b>Did she get it?</b>

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.160
<b>Target neutralized.</b>

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.420
<b>It was a success.</b>

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.990
<b>Th-There's another one!</b>

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.660
<b>Another satellite has appeared!</b>

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:42.870
<b>Camael!</b>

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:48.870
<b>Commander!</b>

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.800
<b>Commander, you need to stop.</b>

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.460
<b>Kotori, is that...</b>

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.720
<b>A second one.</b>

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:04.000
<b>Stand still, we're going to beam you into the Fraxinus.</b>

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:05.850
<b>What about the shelters?!</b>

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.480
<b>No...</b>

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.720
<b>But there are still—</b>

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:11.700
<b>Please...</b>

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:17.360
<b>When you're thinking about who to protect,
 remember that you should include yourself!</b>

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.910
<b>Shidou? Shidou?!</b>

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.760
<b>Shidou!</b>

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.250
<b>Kotori, what's going on?</b>

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.140
<b>Um, what's happening?</b>

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.780
<b>Is this one of those sticky situations?</b>

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:36.900
<b>You should be ashamed of yourself for getting so frightened over something this trivial.</b>

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.500
<b>Agreement: Compose yourself.</b>

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.260
<b>That's a satellite, right?</b>

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.010
<b>Wh-What are you all doing there?</b>

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.880
<b>Kotori, I can't find Shido...</b>

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.100
<b>Shidou, huh?</b>

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:56.070
<b>Kotori, is there anything that we can do?</b>

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.600
<b>Please, all of you... save him...</b>

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:05.800
<b>Protect my one and only brother!</b>

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.910
<b><i>It's all up to me.</i></b>

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:13.580
<b><i>Sandalphon... Lend me your strength!</i></b>

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.920
<b>This is all I need!</b>

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.350
<b>Shidou-san!</b>

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:38.360
<b>Why... Why are you all here?</b>

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:43.240
<b>We had Kotori transport us here after hearing you were in trouble.</b>

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:46.200
<b>I see. How are they doing?</b>

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.920
<b>They're fighting an enemy ship right now.</b>

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.440
<b>I don't think we need to worry about them too much.</b>

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.700
<b>Thanks. I really thought I might die.</b>

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:02.630
At first it was just a blurred line

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:02.630
At first it was just a blurred line

