00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.340
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.380
<b>I'm so sorry for everything I did! {CR: Doing all those bad things...}{fine}</b>

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:28.320
<b>I'm sorry for scaring all of you!{CR: Causing all of you trouble...}{fine}</b>

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:31.140
<b>When you were all being nice to me...</b>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.120
<b>It made me so happy, but...</b>

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.760
<b>I couldn't thank you...</b>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.660
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

