00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.320
<b>Huh?! I didn't do anything!</b>

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:20.160
<b>I can't leave Natsumi-san to a person who makes her cry.</b>

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:22.390
<b>I'll be your friend!</b>

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.280
