00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.880
<b>I'll allow you to become my underling. {I'm blanking on the appropriate word, but I think there's something better than kinsman that indicates being part a lower member of one's clan.}{TLC - This?}{apprentice can also work as well also retainer, but I think underling works best, trying to think of rikka-equese terms.}</b>

